00:52:43,101 --> 00:52:45,219
Tolonglah, aku butuh bantuanmu.

867
00:52:46,660 --> 00:52:48,979
Baiklah. Kita akan bermain
petak umpet.

868
00:52:49,260 --> 00:52:50,098
Ya! Ya!

869
00:52:50,259 --> 00:52:51,139
Kau mau bantu aku
